        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has an accusation to bring against the people of Judah; he is also going to punish Israel for the way her people act. He will pay them back for what they have done. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.25.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 25.26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.32.24+GEN.32.25+GEN.32.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 32.24–26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Their ancestor Jacob struggled with his twin brother Esau while the two of them were still in their mother's womb; when Jacob grew up, he fought against God — ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.28.10+GEN.28.11+GEN.28.12+GEN.28.13+GEN.28.14+GEN.28.15+GEN.28.16+GEN.28.17+GEN.28.18+GEN.28.19+GEN.28.20+GEN.28.21+GEN.28.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 28.10–22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he fought against an angel and won. He wept and asked for a blessing. And at Bethel God came to our ancestor Jacob and spoke with him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12.4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Some ancient translations",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "him",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "us.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This was the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " God Almighty — the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " is the name by which he is to be worshipped. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So now, descendants of Jacob, trust in your God and return to him. Be loyal and just, and wait patiently for your God to act.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says, “The people of Israel are as dishonest as the Canaanites; they love to cheat their customers with false scales. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘We are rich,’ they say. ‘We've made a fortune. And no one can accuse us of getting rich dishonestly.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.23.42+LEV.23.43"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 23.42–43",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God who led you out of Egypt, I will make you live in tents again, as you did when I came to you in the desert.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I spoke to the prophets and gave them many visions, and through the prophets I gave my people warnings. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yet idols are worshipped in Gilead, and those who worship them will die. Bulls are sacrificed in Gilgal, and the altars there will become piles of stone in the open fields.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.29.1+GEN.29.2+GEN.29.3+GEN.29.4+GEN.29.5+GEN.29.6+GEN.29.7+GEN.29.8+GEN.29.9+GEN.29.10+GEN.29.11+GEN.29.12+GEN.29.13+GEN.29.14+GEN.29.15+GEN.29.16+GEN.29.17+GEN.29.18+GEN.29.19+GEN.29.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 29.1–20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Our ancestor Jacob had to flee to Mesopotamia, where, in order to get a wife, he worked for another man and took care of his sheep. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.50+EXO.12.51"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ex 12.50–51",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " sent a prophet to rescue the people of Israel from slavery in Egypt and to take care of them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The people of Israel have made the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " bitterly angry; they deserve death for their crimes. Their Lord will punish them for the disgrace they have brought on him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
